Subject: [PATCH] Phase 4.4a step 3: standalone RegionClusterer

Union-find clustering of online players by Chebyshev chunk distance into
square-footprint regions, with sticky region ids reused via greedy
overlap matching against the previous tick's regions (ties broken by the
smaller old region id). Not wired into any tick path yet - pure logic,
verified by RegionClustererTest (11 cases, all passing under
:lcsxnmc-server:test's NormalTestSuite).

